**.subckt assignrca1
x1 VDD gnd val0 val0 val1 val1 val1 val1 val0 val0 val0 val1 val0 val1 val1 val0 val0 val1 cin net2 sout3 net1 sout6 sout2 sout5
+ sout4 sout1 sout0 rca8
vdd VDD gnd 1.8
